WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:02.502
♪♪

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.087
NARRATOR:
Medieval France.

00:00:04.213 --> 00:00:07.674
NARRATOR:
A time that ushered in a new era
of nobility.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.135
Have another guard kill that
one. 

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.053
Yes, sire.

00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:12.554
I'm sorry, who?

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:13.430
Kill him.

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:17.184
No, I couldn't my lord. I have
known Arnaud my entire life. We
came up together as squires.

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:21.480
Would it be easier if we got a
third guard to come in and kill
both of these guys?

00:00:21.647 --> 00:00:22.981
Oh whoops, here we go.

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:23.899
Agh!

00:00:23.941 --> 00:00:24.858
Agh!

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:28.320
Ahhh!

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:30.781
Good work.

00:00:30.781 --> 00:00:31.365
(Sigh)

00:00:32.491 --> 00:00:34.910
Quasi! Quasi! Quasi!

00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:36.286
Holy shit.

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.496
Come on, we're going to be late.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:41.291
♪♪

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.292
You know what your problem is?

00:00:42.334 --> 00:00:45.587
Is it that I've got a fatty
deposit the size of a giant
gourd on my back?

00:00:45.796 --> 00:00:46.755
Weirdo!

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:47.506
Freak!

00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:49.299
-Hunchback.
-Morning!

00:00:49.341 --> 00:00:52.135
♪♪

00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:54.972
Ah, the royal torture chamber.
Back to the daily grind.

00:00:55.097 --> 00:00:56.556
Ughh!

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:57.557
You guys psyched for Pope Week?

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.142
Oh my God, here we go. Another
Pope Week.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:00.602
Pope Week. I love Pope Week.

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:03.939
Who wants to see an exorcism?!

00:01:03.981 --> 00:01:05.357
(Crowd cheers)

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:07.025
Welcome to the Papal lottery. 

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:09.319
HENRI-FRANÇOISE:
Winner of the lottery shall have
his private 

00:01:09.319 --> 00:01:11.405
confession heard by
the Pope himself.

00:01:11.405 --> 00:01:12.406
Quasi, you won. 

00:01:12.698 --> 00:01:15.909
A hunchback, no! Do you have any
idea the questions he’ll have
for me?

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:20.622
Holy Father, can you fix my
hump? Is not my very existence
proof there is no God?

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:22.541
I don’t want to get into that
whole hornet’s nest.

00:01:23.292 --> 00:01:25.544
Quasi, Quasi, Quasi!

00:01:25.544 --> 00:01:26.795
Are you going to ask for a new
back?

00:01:26.795 --> 00:01:28.130
Oh yeah, like a tall back maybe?

00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:29.589
Or perhaps a new face?

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:30.882
No mom would like that face.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.342
It'd be like put it back in my
vagina.

00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:33.051
Okay.

00:01:33.385 --> 00:01:34.803
NARRATOR:
On 4/20,

00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:37.806
NARRATOR:
in a tale of love.

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.142
I very much like your rack.

00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:41.351
And I, yours.

00:01:43.395 --> 00:01:44.229
NARRATOR:
Betrayal. 

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:47.399
NARRATOR:
And Scandal.

00:01:47.441 --> 00:01:53.613
Quasi, these are actual
depictions of the Pope having
sex with Saracen women. 

00:01:54.323 --> 00:01:56.825
Oh mon dieu! Is that mud?

00:01:57.159 --> 00:01:59.411
It’s not mud. It’s not mud.

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:01.371
NARRATOR:
Everyone plays a part. 

00:02:02.748 --> 00:02:03.915
NARRATOR:
Or two.

00:02:03.999 --> 00:02:09.588
♪♪

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:11.340
Send a warning shot. Shoot over
their heads.

00:02:11.423 --> 00:02:12.257
Yes, my lord. 

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:15.052
Michel!

00:02:15.177 --> 00:02:16.428
Whoops!

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:17.888
I said shoot over their heads.

00:02:17.929 --> 00:02:19.723
I’m not even sure that that was
my arrow.

00:02:19.765 --> 00:02:21.141
I saw it come out of your
crossbow.

00:02:21.224 --> 00:02:22.976
You know what, that was
Gregor’s. Gregor!

